      'Verse and prose boundaries, repeated formulae and shifts in speaker are major evidence for internal redaction.',
      '“Tat tvam asi” translation is doctrinally loaded. A historical edition should present grammar and context before choosing a Vedanta metaphysics.',
      'Olivelle’s critical text plus study of the Chandogya Brahmana context is the necessary base for any claim about early meaning.'
